86:/// One packed batch sitting in an exchange staging arena as cudf packed bytes.
87:///
88:/// The neutral wire shape of the nixl tier: on the sender it names a lease in the *local* arena
89:/// (filled by `export_packed`), on the receiver a lease in the *receiver's* arena (filled by a
90:/// nixl WRITE). Whoever holds the arena releases the lease after the bytes leave it.
